2
00:03:23,100 --> 00:03:29,900
so, everything that makes me whole 今君に捧げよう
So, everything that makes me whole, I'll dedicate to you now...

3
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,800
I'm yours

4
00:03:58,300 --> 00:04:05,200
ねえ こんなに笑えたこと
Hey, being able to smile this much...

5
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:11,200
生まれて初めてだよ
is a first in my life.

6
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:18,300
きっと 私はね
I'm sure...

7
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:28,200
この日の為に間違いだらけの
I walked down a path full of mistakes just for this day.

8
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:34,400
道を歩いてきたんだ
...

9
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:41,400
ずっと 一人で
All alone, all this time...

10
00:04:42,300 --> 00:04:48,700
遠く遠く どこまでも遠く 君と二人
Far, far away, no matter how far, the two of us together...

11
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:55,400
手を取って 永遠に どこまでだって行けるはず
holding hands into eternity, we can go anywhere.

12
00:04:56,300 --> 00:04:59,900
もう一人じゃないよ
I'm not alone anymore.

13
00:05:00,024 --> 00:05:09,144
君はそう言いまた笑う
You say that and smile once again...

14
00:05:12,344 --> 00:05:17,484
守るべき大事なものが今あって
Now that I have something precious to protect,

15
00:05:18,584 --> 00:05:23,244
だけど成すすべもなく立ち尽くす時は
But when I stand helpless with nowhere to turn,

16
00:05:23,844 --> 00:05:33,684
可能性を失って暗闇が君を覆い隠し絶望に飲みこまれそうな時は
When you lose all your possibilities, and the darkness shrouds you and swallows you in despair,

17
00:05:34,924 --> 00:05:40,464
私が君を照らす明りになるから
I will become the light that illuminates you.

18
00:05:41,024 --> 00:05:45,924
たとえこの世界の王にだって消せはしない
Even if the king of this world tries to erase it, it cannot be undone.

19
00:05:46,444 --> 00:05:53,404
So, everything that makes me whole 今君に捧げよう
So, everything that makes me whole, I offer to you now.

20
00:05:57,184 --> 00:05:59,404
I'm Yours

21
00:06:03,964 --> 00:06:11,184
ねえ この世界にはたくさんの幸せがあるんだね
Hey, there is so much happiness in this world, isn't there?

22
00:06:17,384 --> 00:06:24,324
いつか二人なら…
Someday, if the two of us...

23
00:06:26,524 --> 00:06:31,564
誰かが君のことを嘘つきと呼んで
Even if someone calls you a liar,

24
00:06:32,424 --> 00:06:37,884
心無い言葉で傷つけようとしても
And tries to hurt you with heartless words,

25
00:06:38,264 --> 00:06:48,364
世界が君のことを信じようともせずに茨の冠を被せようとしても
Even if the world refuses to believe in you and tries to crown you with thorns,

26
00:06:49,264 --> 00:06:54,444
私は君だけの味方になれるよ
I can be your one and only ally.

27
00:06:55,004 --> 00:07:00,204
その孤独 痛みを私は知っている
I know that lonely pain.

28
00:07:01,084 --> 00:07:08,164
So, everything that makes me whole 今君に捧げよう
So, everything that makes me whole, I offer to you now.

29
00:07:11,244 --> 00:07:13,804
I'm Yours

30
00:07:46,644 --> 00:07:51,144
いつか私を知ることができたなら
If you ever come to know who I am,

31
00:07:52,224 --> 00:07:57,384
必ずその場所に私はいるから
I will surely be there in that place.

32
00:07:58,244 --> 00:08:09,124
そこに希望の欠片すらなかったとしても私が在ってはならないものであっても
Even if not a single fragment of hope is found there, even if I am something that shouldn't exist,

33
00:08:09,824 --> 00:08:14,644
君は忘れないでいてくれることを
You will remember me, won't you?

34
00:08:15,524 --> 00:08:25,544
誰よりも私がそのことを知っているだから私は君のために全てを今捧げよう
More than anyone else, I know that—that's why I will give everything for you right now.

35
00:08:32,084 --> 00:08:36,484
今捧げよう
I offer it to you now.

36
00:09:01,844 --> 00:09:06,204
鉄の弾が正義の証明貫けば英雄に近づいた
Iron bullets are the proof of justice; pierce through them and you draw closer to a hero.

37
00:09:07,124 --> 00:09:14,244
その目を閉じて触れてみれば同じ形同じ体温の悪魔
Close your eyes and touch—a demon of the same shape and the same warmth.

38
00:09:15,124 --> 00:09:25,444
僕はダメであいつはいいの？そこに壁があっただけなのに生まれてしまった運命嘆くな僕らはみんな自由なんだから
Why am I bad while they are good? Even though there was just a wall there, don't lament the fate you were born into, because we are all free.

39
00:10:00,572 --> 00:10:02,472
それでも君を愛すよ
I love you...

40
00:10:02,472 --> 00:10:05,812
なにを犠牲にしても
No matter what I have to sacrifice,

41
00:10:05,812 --> 00:10:09,452
それでも君を守るよ
Even so, I will protect you.

42
00:10:09,452 --> 00:10:13,402
間違いだとしても
Even if it's a mistake,

43
00:10:13,402 --> 00:10:17,222
疑ったりしない
I won't have any doubts.

44
00:10:17,222 --> 00:10:24,102
正しさとは 自分のこと 強く信じることだ
Righteousness means believing strongly in oneself.

45
00:10:33,932 --> 00:10:38,582
鉄の雨が 降り散る情景
The scene of iron rain pouring down

46
00:10:38,582 --> 00:10:43,812
テレビの中 映画に見えたんだ
looked like a movie inside the TV.

47
00:10:43,812 --> 00:10:49,902
戦争なんて 愚かな凶暴 関係ない 知らない国の話
War is such foolish violence, a story of an unknown country that has nothing to do with us.

48
00:10:49,902 --> 00:10:55,952
それならなんで あいつ憎んで 黒い気持ち 隠しきれない理由
Then why hate them? The reason we can't hide our dark feelings...

49
00:11:17,492 --> 00:11:21,232
この言葉も
Even these words

50
00:11:21,232 --> 00:11:26,562
訳されれば
if translated,

51
00:11:26,562 --> 00:11:30,592
本当の意味は伝わらない
their true meaning won't get across.

52
00:11:30,592 --> 00:11:37,352
信じるのは その目を開いて 触れた世界だけ
What to believe in is only the world you've touched with your eyes open.

53
00:11:37,352 --> 00:11:44,992
ただただ生きるのは嫌だ
I hate just living blindly...

54
00:11:46,512 --> 00:11:51,662
世界は残酷だ
The world is cruel.

55
00:11:51,662 --> 00:11:55,802
それでも君を愛すよ
Even so, I love you.

56
00:11:55,802 --> 00:12:01,342
なにを犠牲にしても
No matter what I have to sacrifice,

57
00:12:01,342 --> 00:12:07,432
それでも君を守るよ
Even so, I will protect you.

58
00:12:07,432 --> 00:12:14,392
選んだ人の影 捨てたものの屍
The shadow of the chosen person, the corpse of what was thrown away.

59
00:12:14,392 --> 00:12:22,582
気づいたんだ 自分の中 育つのは悪魔の子
I realized, growing inside me is a demon child.

